# npm falls back to .gitignore when this file is missing, which would drop the
# compiled Rust from the tarball and ship a package that throws at app boot.
# With this file present the `files` allowlist in package.json is what decides.

# Cargo intermediates. rust/ ships (the crate source is the record of what the
# binaries were built from) but its build directory is ~1.6GB.
rust/target/

# Gradle and CMake scratch inside the shipped android/ tree.
android/.cxx/
